{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Deep in an abandonned moon complex, Red sends a distress call. Everybody has died. Device spheres are still active and the sentinels also. You have to find a MindGun. Save Red.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rotate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You interact with core elements by <strong>rotating them</strong>. The MindGun has been designed to handle the specific needs of the complex. Manage threats and devices by mastering this tool. <strong>Shoot, rotate, repulse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/Rotate.gif?t=1744297853\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Red thought he was alone: it is not the case anymore. <strong>Sneak is often the best first move</strong> before encountering situations that will be increasingly more difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The whole area has been abandonned since obscure events: be aware of your surroundings.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/Explore.gif?t=1744297853\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">People were about to discover leaks in multiple systems, including Red's <strong>propagation of dissonance</strong>.\u00a0 May the body's recollections say the origins of the malaise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/Survive.gif?t=1744297853\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Forward backward</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The place is a maze. Spatial awarness will save you time and effort in both threats encounters and puzzle progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You don't know why you're here and it doesn't matter:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>what's important is for Red to <strong>remember why</strong> you came.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/extras/Forward.gif?t=1744297853\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598550?t=1744297853","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598550?t=1744297853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/f38b5ff94a94b97e594a177798388b26262e0ba6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744297853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598550/f38b5ff94a94b97e594a177798388b26262e0ba6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744297853","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Threats that the player will encounter in the game are the result of biotechnological experiments that has either gone wrong or been abandonned. Their depiction and the reasons of its very existence might not be suitable for a certain audience."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Deep in an abandonned moon complex, Red sends a distress call. Everybody has died. Device spheres are still active and the sentinels also. You have to find a MindGun. Save Red.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rotate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You interact with core elements by <strong>rotating them</strong>. The MindGun has been designed to handle the specific needs of the complex. Manage threats and devices by mastering this tool. <strong>Shoot, rotate, repulse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets